  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">You can speak to the heart, couching your intent through philosophy and your actions to make the best efforts to bridge your gap to others. You gain the Glad-Hand and Exhort the Faithful feat, even if you do not meet their prerequisites. You can use your Religion skill to Make an Impression with Glad-Hand, and even if you do not follow a faith, you can use Exhort the Faithful on someone who shares a culture, a philosophy, or a faith your ancestors followed.</span></p>"
